|| {prāsādacandrikā} ||

(* * *) dikākhya kalāsu  madhyatrikatrikeṇāṃ lirahātriśūnyam ekaikahāne 
triśūnyam śūnyāt paraṃ yojayathāmaśaivam |

śūnyaṃ tāvat samākhyātaṃ sāmarasyaṃ nibodha me |
ātmanye (* * * * * *) tro jñeyo dvitīyakam || 1 ||

tṛtīyaṃ nāḍisaṃsthaṃ tu śaktau kuryāccaturthakam |
pañcamaṃ vyāpine sthāne samanāyāṃ tu ṣaṣṭhakam || 2 ||

tatve samaraso deva saptamaṃ tu vidhīyate |
śiṣyātmāna hya pūrvoktavidhinā kramāt || 3 ||

paścādātmani saṃyojya lolībhūtaṃ vicintayet |
pūrakaṃ kuṃbhakaṃ kṛtvā samānena nirodhayet || 4 ||

yāvatyo nāḍayo dehe tiryagūrdhvamadha (* *) |
samānena samākṛṣṭamekī bhūtā bhavanti tāḥ || 5 ||

tāsu vai vāyavaste'pi prāṇena samarasaṃgatāḥ |
nāḍyastu suṣumnāyām ekībhūtā vyavasthitāḥ || 6 ||

<p. 2>

tato vai uccarenmantraṃ nā (* * * *) cintayet |
mantramātmā tathā nāḍirevaṃ samarasaṃ bhavet || 7 ||

vāmadakṣiṇaūrdhve tu tato nāḍiṃ pramocayet |
setubandhena yanmārgaṃ tatra gatvā na jāyate || 8 ||

brahmā viṣṇuśca rudraśca īśvaraśca sadāśivaḥ |
ete'tra samatāṃ yānti tanmayāta pṛthak pṛthak || 9 ||

tasmin samuccarennādo yāvacchaktau layaṃgataḥ |
śaktimadhyagato noḍeśśaktyā tā (* * *) yate || 10 ||

sarvaṃ śaktimayān tatra sarvaṃ samarasaṃ bhavet |
tadūrdhvaṃ vyāpinīṃ vyāpya sarvaṃ tanmayatāṃ vrajet || 11 ||

samantād vyapnaved yasmāt vyāpinītyabhidhīyate |
(* *) mūrdhve samanāṃ prāpya tanmayatvaṃ vrajet punaḥ || 12 ||

sā ca sarvagatā jñeyā sāmarasyena saṃsthitā |
ṣaṣṭhaṃ samarasaṃ tyaktvā saptamaṃ tu tato vrajet || 13 ||

taṃ mā (* * * * * * )bhavatyapi vicāraṇāt |
sa ca sarveṣu bhūteṣu bhāva tatvendriyeṣu ca || 14 ||

sthāvare jaṅgame caiva cetanā cetane sthitaḥ |
ūrdhvā na vyāpya sarvaṃ tu sāmarasyena saṃsthitaḥ || 15 ||

pranaha (* * * * * *) nināmapi yo manaḥ |
yasyājñā samayobhāvasthiraḥ pūrṇasamaṃ tataḥ || 16 ||

<p. 3>

evaṃ samarasaḥ prokto viṣuvaṃ tu nibodhate |
prathamaṃ prāṇaviṣuvaṃ mantro jñeyaṃ mantro (*) kam || 17 ||

tṛtīyaṃ nāḍiviṣuvaṃ praśāntaṃ ca caturthakam |
pañcamaṃ śaktiviṣuvaṃ ṣaṣṭhaṃ vaikalyamucyate || 18 ||

saptamaṃ tatvaviṣuvaṃ pravibhāgastvathocyate |
ātmānaṃ ca manaḥ prāṇaissaṃyojya viṣuvaṃ || 19 ||

(*) viṣuvamākhyātaṃ mantraṃ viṣuvamucyate |
mantramuccārayed yāvattāvannānyamanā bhavet || 20 ||

parāparavibhāgena mantrātmānaṃ taducyate |
mantraṃ viṣuvami (* * * * *) sthānaṃ nibodhate || 21 ||

sarvāsāmeva nāḍīnāṃ madhye yāṃ saṃvyavasthitā |
suṣumnā nāma sā jñeyā nāḍīśaktyā śivaṃ gatā || 22 ||

tatra pravāhayennādaṃ nāḍī viṣa (* * * *) |
(* * *) viṣuvaṃ caiva adhunā kathayāmi te || 23 ||

prāṇena tu samuccārya kāraṇānyaṅguleṅgule |
tānyavasthātparityajya kāraṇāni ṣaḍeva tu || 24 ||

saptame (* * * * *) praśāntendriyagocaram |
praśāntastamito jñeyostimite niścalassmṛtaḥ || 25 ||

niścalo nistaraṃgaśca sthirapūrṇassamaṃ tataḥ |
evaṃ bhavaṃ sa (mā) sthāya deśā (* * * * * *) || 26 ||

<p. 4>

etatpraśāntaviṣuvaṃ śaktyupādhirnibodhame |
śaktimadhye gato nādaḥ tadūrdhvaṃ kecaredyadā || 27 ||

tāvattacchakti viṣuvaṃ kālākhyaṃ tu nibodhame |
tṛṭa ṣoḍaśikāyā tu prāṇa (* * * * *) || 28 ||

kālo bhrūkṣepamātrastu tantrānte kathito mayā |
parāpara vibhāvena punareva tridhā kuru || 29 ||

aparaṣṣoḍaśī yāvat kālassaptadaśaḥ paraḥ |
parāparastu yatkālaḥ supriya (* * * *) prabhuḥ || 30 ||

prāṇamekaṃ tridhākālaṃ kṛtvā caivaṃ yajetpunaḥ |
aparaśśaśimūrdhvastho vyāpinyāṃ tu dvitīyakaḥ || 31 ||

tṛtīyaṃ samanāsthāne kālo viṣuvamucyate |
(* *) ḥ samākhyātaḥ saptamaṃ tatvamucyate || 32 ||

unmanā paritā devi tatrātmānaṃ niyojayet |
tasminyuktastato hyātma tanmayaṃ ca prajāyate || 33 ||

tatvākhyaṃ vi (* * *) vi sarveṣāṃ parata sthitaḥ |
viṣuvaṃ nyaivaṃ vidhaṃ jñātvā ko na mucyeta bandhanāt || 34 ||


evaṃ viṣuvamākhyātaṃ yojanā ca tathocyate |
mantrabhāvakriyā (*) yojanāyetu pare śive || 35 ||

vidyātatvāspadaṃ budhvā bindutatvāsane sthitaḥ |
nādaśaktitanuścaiva vyāpinīkaraṇānvitaḥ || 36 ||

sarvaṃ jñātvāvabodhena samanāntaṃ carestu saḥ |
(* * * *) tparaṃ proktaṃ tena cā pūritā tanuḥ || 37 ||

adhvātītaṃ paraṃ proktaṃ paraṃ cādhvamadhyamedhyagam |
pūrṇāhutyā rasopeta paśuṃ yojayate pare || 38 ||

ūrdhvaṃ (* * *) vassaha samapādo vyavasthitaḥ |
nābhisthāne sṛjenmūlaṃ mukhenāgramukhaṃ samam || 39 ||

sṛcopari sṛcaṃ devī kritvā caiva madhomukham |
puṣpaṃ datvā sṛvāle tu darbhena sahitau karau || 40 ||

ma (* * * *) hastābhyāṃ gṛhītvā yatnato'pi ca |
mukhāgre dakṣiṇaṃ hastaṃ vāmaṃ vai pṛṣṭhataḥ priye || 41 ||

muṣṭibhyāṃ saṃgṛhītvā tu utthānakarayogataḥ |
tato tena saṃprāpya abhimānaṃ tu kāra (* *) || 42 ||

(* *) hameva paraṃ tatvaṃ parāpara vibhāgataḥ |
tatvamekaṃ hi sarvatra nānyabhāvaṃ tu kārayet || 43 ||

bhedayenmantraśūlena mudrābhāvayutena ca |
mantro vai jñānaśaktiṃ ca caiva kriyātmikā || 44 ||

bhāvaśca mana ityuktaṃ tanmaṇā buddhipūrvakam |
varaśca manasāgamya icchāśaktyātvadhiṣṭhitaḥ || 45 ||

yatra yatra bhavedicchā jñānaṃ tatra pravarta |
(* *) karaṇasaṃyogāt tatvasvoccāraṇaṃ bhavet || 46 ||

<p. 6>

kriyākaraṇahīnasya na caivoccāraṇaṃ bhavet |
kriyākaraṇarūpeṇa na caiva trividhā smṛtā || 47 ||

e (* * * * *) tatvaṃ karaṇena vicakṣaṇaḥ |
nātyuccaraṃ dvitīyena dvārāṇāṃ saṃ nirodhanam || 48 ||

tṛtīyaṃ karaṇaṃ divyaṃ krītvā vai tatvamucaret |
pūrakaṃ kuṃ (* * * * * *) dvārāṇi pādayet || 49 ||

gudadvāreṇa ruddhena sarve ruddhā bhavanti hi |
dvāramekaṃ dvitaṃ cordhve pravāhāttadvicintayet || 50 ||

nā (* * * * * * * * * * * * * * *) |
(* * * * * * * *( śca sādā mukhagataścaye || 51 ||

te kuṃbhakena saṃkuṃbhya vikasanti samantataḥ |
kāraṇaṃ tu tataḥ kṛtvā lakṣaṇaṃ tasya vai śṛṇu || 52 ||

jihvāṃ tu tāluke yojya kiñcidūrdhvaṃ (* * * *) |
(* *) tprāsārya vaktraṃ tu kiñcidoṣṭhena saṃspṛśet || 53 ||

dantapaṅktiṃ tadaiveha dṛṣṭiścā yordhvavarjitaḥ |
kāyaṃ samunnataṃ kṛtvā karaṇaṃ divyamucyate || 54 ||

divyaṃ ca karaṇa (* * *) trasyoccāraṇaṃ kuru |
kuṃbhitaścaiva yaḥ prāṇo recayettaṃ śanaiśśaniḥ || 55 ||

nāḍayo granthipadmāśca dehe evaṃ vyavasthitāḥ |
recakena samākṣipya ūrdhva sroto (* * * *) t || 56 ||

<p. 7>

tato vijñānaśūlena granthīn bhindansamuccaret |
bhitvā hṛtpadmagranthiṃ tu śabdo dhunudhunāyate || 57 ||

tālumadhyagataprāṇo yadā bhavati muccataḥ |
bindhatastā granthisuśabdo ghumughumāyate || 54 ||

evaṃ te'nubhavāḥ proktāḥ prāṇe carati suvrate |
tisraste tu kalāḥ proktā uparyupari tāḥ kramāt || 59 ||

tiṣṭhate yatra vai ptā (*) māta tadgatimāvyayāt |
tattadrūpaṃ bhavettasya dhāśa bhāvānurūpataḥ || 60 ||

bhruvormadhye yadā gacchet sphoṭaśabdaḥ prajāyate |
binduṃ bhedayato devi śabdodhu madhamāyate || 61 ||

kapilaitthairnālikereṇa ācāryassaha bindunā |
abhinno mokṣamanaṃ bāhyābhyantaraṃ vinā || 62 ||

bhitvā binduṃ (* * * *) ardhacandraṃ vibhāvayet |
bhindataścārdha candraśca phāle simisimāyate || 63 ||

ardhacandraṃ tu bhitvā vai bhedayettu nirodhinam |
tasyāṃ tu bhiyamānāyāṃ śabdaśśimiśimāyate || 64 ||

sthānatrayamidaṃ devi pañcapañcakalānvitam |
prāṇassacaratistatra yasminsthānena tiṣṭhati || 65 ||

tattadrūpaṃ bhavedātmā tāṃ tāṃ gatimavāpnuyāt |
nirodhinīṃ bhedayitvā tu tato nādaṃ vrajetpunaḥ || 66 ||

<p. 8>

vaṃśaśabdassamaśśabdaḥ tatra sūkṣmaṃ prajāyate |
bhedayennāda saṃsthānaṃ brahmarandhraṃ sa tu smṛtam || 67 ||

bhindato brahmarandhraṃ tu śabdaśśamaśamāyate |
śaktimadhyagataḥ prāṇo vaṃśanādāntasannibhaḥ || 68 ||

tāṃśca vai bhedayecchaktiṃ durbhedyāṃ sarvayogibhiḥ |
bhidyate ca yadā śaktiśśa (* *) muśumustataḥ || 69 ||

śaktiṃ bhitvā tato devī taccheṣaṃ vyāpinī bhavet |
anubhāve bhavettatra spṛśedyatra pipīlikā || 70 ||

sthānatrayamidaṃ devi pañcaṃ pañcaka tam (* *) |
yatra yatra ca katprāṇaḥ tattadrūpamavāpnuyāt || 71 ||

tasmād vai suprayatnena bhitvā dhāma parāṃ gatim |
bhitvā vai vyāpinaṃ devi na manā (* * * * *) t || 72 ||

manasā tu manastyaktvā jīvaḥ kevalatāṃ vrajet |
jīvo vai kevalastatra ātmā jñānakriyānvitaḥ || 73 ||

bandhanāśeṣanirmuktassa (* *) tra vyavasthitaḥ |
samastādhva padātīta saśśuddhavijñānakevalaḥ || 74 ||

gṛhṇātināparaṃ bhāvaṃ tataḥ paraśivātmakam |
parāpara vinirmuktaḥ svātmanātmā vyavasthitaḥ || 75 ||

ātmavyāptirbhavedeṣā śivavyāpirataḥ param |
indhanāśeṣa bhāvena sarvādhvo pādivarjitam || 76 ||

<p. 9>

viditvā paramaṃ tatvaṃ śivatvaṃ kalpitaṃ tu yaiḥ |
ātmopāyādhikā śaivena gacchanti śivaṃ param || 77 ||

ātmatatvagatiṃ yānti ātmatatvena rañjitāḥ |
tasmādātma parityājyo yadi cecchivamātmanaḥ || 78 ||

ātmatatvaṃ tatastyaktvā vidyātatvaṃ niyojayet |
unmanā sā tu vijñeyā manassaṃkalpya ucyate || 79 ||

saṃkalpya nayato jñeyamunmanā yugapat sthitam |
tasmātsā ca parā vidyā yasmādanyā na vidyate || 80 ||

vindate yatra yugapat sāpyagjñāti guṇānparān |
vedanānādi dharmasya paramātma prabodhanāt || 81 ||

vyañjanā paramārthatve tasmādvidyeti socyate |
tatra vyañjayettejaḥ paraṃ paramakāraṇam || 82 ||

parasmintejasi vyakte tatrasthaśivatāṃ vrajet |
apradapte yathā vahnau śikhā dṛśyeta cāṃbare || 83 ||

daśaprāṇasthi hyātmā tadvallīyeta tatpade |
tadvadevābhimānastu kartavyo deśikottamaiḥ || 84 ||

ahameva paro haṃsaḥ śivaṃ paramakāraṇam |
matprāṇe sa paśyātmalayaṃ sa paramaṃ gataḥ || 85 ||

evaṃ yo vetti tattvena vahnivaddeha madhyataḥ |
yadvadvahnimukhātītastadvadyojayate pare || 86 ||

<p. 10>

sūkṣmasvāyaṃbhuve(-)

yo yatrābhilaṣed bhogān sa tatraiva niyojitaḥ |
siddhibhā mantrasāmardho tattadyojayate pade || 87 ||

tasminyuktaḥ pare tatve sarvajñādiguṇānvitaḥ |
śiva eko bhaved devī avibhāgena sarvataḥ || 88 ||

vahniṃ nirodhabhāvena śivena saha saṃyutaḥ |
anyathā na ced devī nadīvega ivārṇave || 89 ||

sthitassa sāgaredbhistu sindho samarasī bhavet |
punarvibhā nāpnoti tathātmā tu śivārṇave || 90 ||

pūrvoktaṃ tadidaṃ sarvaṃ jñātvā tatve niyojayet |
evamācarate yastu ācāryantu śivātmakam || 91 ||

śivena sahacāritvād ācāryastena socyate |
tasmānmāmānavīṃ buddhiṃ kārayeddeśikaṃ prati || 92 ||

ācāryaṃ ca mantraṃ ca śivajñāne śivasya ca |
nānātmaṃ neva kurvanti videśāścatranāyakaḥ || 93 ||

brāhmaṇā kṣatriyā vaiśyāśśūdro vā vīravandite |
ācāryatve niyuktāye te jayanti śivāssmṛtāḥ || 94 ||

anyathā prāgṛrūpeṇa ye paśyanti narādhamāḥ |
narake te prapaśyante sādākhya vatsaratrayam || 95 ||

na tena saha saṃbhāṣā kartavyā tu śivārthinā |

<p. 11>

kṛtvā saṃbhāṣaṇaṃ tena so'pi gacchati tadgati || 96 ||

tasmācchivasamāssarve draṣṭavyā muktimicchatā |
bhuktimuktiphalavyāptirbhavetyeva tadājñayā || 97 ||

ācāryassvajanānāṃ ca kulakoṭisahasrajaḥ |
jñānajñeya parijñānāt sarvāṃstāṃstārayiṣyati || 98 ||

evamukta vidhānajño tāmajñaścaiva deśikaḥ |
brahmaṇā kṣatriyā vaiśyā śūdrāścānye'thavā priye || 99 ||

sarve te samadharmāṇaḥ śivadhāmani yojitāḥ |
sarve jaṭādharāḥ proktāḥ bhasmoddhūlita vigrahāḥ || 100 ||

ekabhākti bhujassarve sarve ye tu varānane |
putrakāṇāṃ bhavedekassādhakānāṃ tathā bhavet || 101 ||

naiṣṭhikānāṃ bhavedeko na paśyanti vibhedataḥ |
ekaiva sā smṛtā jāti bhairavīyā śivājñayā || 102 ||

mantrametat samāhṛtya prājñātiṃ hyudarayet |
sādhakānāṃ putrakāṇāṃ tathā samayināmapi || 103 ||

prājñātyudīraṇāddevi prāyaścitta bhavennaraḥ |
dinatrayaṃ tu śūdrasya pañcāhaṃ keśavasya ca || 104 ||

pitāmahasya pakṣe kaṃ narake pacyate tu saḥ |
janaḥ śīlo bhavet paścādyadi ceduttamāṃgatim || 105 ||

śrīmatprāsādamantrastu devadevena bhāṣitam |

<p. 12>

saptadhā vartate yastu sarvatīrthaphalaṃ labhet || 106 ||

abrahmacārī brahmacārī asnātasnātako bhavet |
pitṝnpitāmahāṃścaiva tathaiva prapitā mahān || 107 ||

akṣayaṃ śivalokantu yānti sadyatprabhāvataḥ |
prāsādanādamusthāpya japedyassatataṃ naraḥ || 108 ||

aṇimādiguṇaiśvaryaṃ ṣaḍbhirmāsairna saṃśayaḥ |

[iti śrīmatkalālayadevatīrthasya uttarataṭe nivāsi 
jyeṣṭhajñānaprakāśavarācārye tasyāruṇadevena saṃgṛhītāyāṃ 
prāsādacandrikāyāṃ mātrājyotīkāraṇeśvara sthānam
ānādhvasamarasī bhāva viṣuvaśabdayojanavidhānavidhissamāptaḥ] ||

śrīmadarūṇācalāya namaḥ ||

[asmiṃśca kośe prāsādacandrikayā saha tatvasiddhāntavyākhyā 
siddhāntaprakāśikā daśakāryaṃ ṣaḍadhvatriṃśatkalānyāsaḥ 
puruṣārthasudhānidhiḥ suprabhedāgamaḥ iti nāmakā vilikhitā vartante] ||





